{"uuid": "e72245f2-c153-4e79-ba8e-956d18202b48", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "New status indicator (abilities floating change); not D21-sampled (SHA-256 first byte 0x7f). as=player desktop: tapping the ready Thief activates its only ability; the Choose a player prompt names its source with You/Opponent; Opponent banishes the lone Clifftop Marksman from the enemy void (single target auto-answered); the exhausted Thief shows a keyword badge labelled with the gained card's name plus a Has Awakened badge; the battle log reads activated / Marksman was banished / Thief of Memory: Has the abilities of another card (the badge names the card; the log line does not); the gained Fast move ability is then offered on the exhausted Thief, pays 1 energy, and resolves from the Thief's origin with its gained list, moving it to F3. as=player mobile: prompt options unclipped, badges inside the card at 390px. as=enemy mobile (scripted lab activation, first-legal answers): the enemy Thief banishes from its own void and shows both badges; log lines are attributed to the opponent. __caps/console errors empty throughout. A first enemy staging with the only character in the human's void had the lab's first-legal script choose the enemy's own empty void, so nothing was gained, as the rules specify.", "bead": "hv-umm2.110", "commit": "739d2d49fa1c925be80066313d50e264a18dd571", "screens": ["judged-e72245f2-player-start-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-choose-player-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-gained-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-log-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-gained-ability-prompt-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-moved-desktop.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-badges-zoom.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-choose-player-mobile.png", "judged-e72245f2-player-gained-mobile.png", "judged-e72245f2-enemy-gained-mobile.png", "judged-e72245f2-enemy-log-mobile.png"]}
